      "updated": 1792382399056,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• source 块：声明输入源类型 (trigger / udp / sim)、监听端口、内置解码器 (forza/outgauge/dirt) 与动态字段偏移",
      "fontSize": 14.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• source 块：声明输入源类型 (trigger / udp / sim)、监听端口、内置解码器 (forza/outgauge/dirt) 与动态字段偏移",
